{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through a claustrophobic cave using a unique, immersive movement mechanic. Use your mouse (or controller) to physically drag yourself through the world. Explore twisting caverns, ancient ruins, and cramped chambers while avoiding the cyclops, Polyphemus, and the other creatures in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyphemus features a unique, immersive, and visceral movement mechanic where you use your mouse or controller to physically drag yourself through the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/extras/45bdb291a976b60ea96d4866542a5caa.poster.avif?t=1773184826\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/extras/45bdb291a976b60ea96d4866542a5caa.webm?t=1773184826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/extras/45bdb291a976b60ea96d4866542a5caa.mp4?t=1773184826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you awake in the deep dark cavern, you remember only two things. Your name is Nobody, and you are not supposed to be here. To escape, you must drag yourself through the treacherous cave and make sure not to get killed by the roaming cyclops or his servants. As you explore the cave, you will find notes from others trapped and slowly come to recall a conversation you had with the cyclops that calls the place home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560960?t=1773184826","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560960?t=1773184826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/2691cd819b1b76d6404ddb640e730faf8410f0bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773184826","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/2691cd819b1b76d6404ddb640e730faf8410f0bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773184826","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Depictions of nude ancient greek statues, gore, death, and mutilation in a pixelated style."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through a claustrophobic cave using a unique, immersive movement mechanic. Use your mouse (or controller) to physically drag yourself through the world. Explore twisting caverns, ancient ruins, and cramped chambers while avoiding the cyclops, Polyphemus, and the other creatures in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyphemus features a unique, immersive, and visceral movement mechanic where you use your mouse or controller to physically drag yourself through the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/extras/45bdb291a976b60ea96d4866542a5caa.poster.avif?t=1773184826\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/extras/45bdb291a976b60ea96d4866542a5caa.webm?t=1773184826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560960/extras/45bdb291a976b60ea96d4866542a5caa.mp4?t=1773184826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"